{title: I Want You To Know About Jesus}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{key: A}
{tempo: 123}

Lyrics
[Bm7](Drum and Piano Introduction for 12 Measures)

Verse 1
[E]I am [G#]alive,
[E]For [F#]I've [F#m]received [C#m]the grace [A]of [D]God
[F]As my [A]own.
[Bm7]I [A]testify
[F#m]No greater [A]love or healing [D]pow'r
[Bm]Have [Bm7]I [Bm]known...

Chorus 1
[C#m]I [E7]want [D]you [A]to [E]know about Jesus:
[C#m]He took [D]away my [A]sin,
By [D]grace, I'm born [E]again.
For peace [A]evermore, [E]turn to [F#m]Jesus,
[C#m]The [D]One who offers [E7]life [E]without [A]end!

Verse 2
[A]The fear I [E]knew
[E]Was [F#m]gone the day [A]I gave the [D]Lord
[F]all [G7]control.
[A]His [A]Word is [E]true:
[F#m]The Living [A]Water [D]overflows
[Bm7]In my soul!

Chorus 2
[C#m7]I [D]want you to [E]know about Jesus:
[C#m]There [Dmaj7]is [D]no greater Friend;
[A]Salvation [D]is in [E]Him.
For [A]peace evermore, [E]turn [C#m]to [F#m]Jesus;
[F#m7]Receive [Dmaj7]the [D]life that [E]never will [A]end!

Bridge
[F]Don't let this present world enslave [A]you;
[F]Call out to Jesus He will save [A]you.
There's [F]peace and comfort
Which the [A]Lord alone [E]can [F#m7]give.
[F#m7]The [D]Shepherd's calling you,
So [E]turn to Him and live!

Chorus 3
I want you to know about Jesus:
[G#]There [E]is no greater Friend;
[B7]Salvation is in [E]Him.
For [A]peace evermore, [E]turn to [F#m]Jesus;
[C#m]Receive [D]the life that [E]never will [A]end,
[F#m7]Complete, [D]redeeming [E]pardon from sin,
[F#m]And [D]let the joy of [E]heaven begin!
